F THE DAY\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: WHO WANTS TO BE A BILLIONAIRE?\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MASSIVE POWERBALL JACKPOT JUMPS AGAIN AFTER NO BIG WINNER\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: AHEAD ON GMA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: AS SEEN ON SOCIAL, 8:21\par \par \uc2 STORM, WEATHER, TORNADO, HAIL, WINDS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MAJOR SPRING STORM ON THE MOVIE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: THREATS OF TORNADOES, HAIL, THUNDERSTORMS & WINDS\par \par \uc2 ABORTION, FLORIDA, RULING, REFERENDUM\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MAJOR FLORIDA ABORTION RULINGS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: COURT ALLOWS SIX-WEEK BAN\par \par \uc2 MENTAL HEALTH, CHILDREN, PANDEMIC, STUDY\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: YOUNG PEOPLE & MENTAL HEALTH\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: STUDY FOUND INCREASING ER VISITS DURING PANDEMIC\par \par \uc2 BLUDER, IOWA, HAWKEYES, BASKETBALL, WOMEN, VICTORY\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: IOWA HEADED BACK TO THE FINAL FOUR\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: COACH LISA BLUDER ON BEATING \uc2 LSU\uc2  IN REMATCH\par \par \uc2 BEYONCE, "THE ROSES", NYE\par \par \uc2 SHOPPING, SOCIAL MEDIA, REVIEW, PRODUCTS\par \par \uc2 GAME, COMMUNICATION, SIMONE, ENGAGED\par \par \uc2 "VANDERPUMP VILLA", REALITY, TV, FRANCE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: INSIDE THE "VANDERPUMP VILLA"\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: BEHIND THE SCENES OF LISA VANDERPUMP'S NEW SERIES\par \par \uc2 GEORGE STEPHANOPOULOS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Lisa Vanderpump became famous on "The Real Housewives of Beverly Hills" and built a reality show empire. Lama Hassan has a look at Lisa's latest series, "Vanderpump Villa." Good morning, Lama.\par \par \uc2 LAMA HASAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Yeah, good morning to you, George. The queen of reality TV, Lisa Vanderpump, has a brand new show, following the lives of a hand-picked staff as they live and work together in a French chateau. Now, you know there's bound to be chaos and confrontation, and we got a sneak peek while they were filming in the gorgeous countryside of\u160\'00\'A0where else but the South of France.\par \par \uc2 LAMA HASAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Queen of all things hospitality and reality TV...\par \par \uc2 LISA VANDERPUMP ("VANDERPUMP VILLA")\par \par \uc2 Throw me to the wolves, and I shall return leading the pack.\par \par \uc2 LISA VANDERPUMP ("VANDERPUMP VILLA")\par \par \uc2 I'm not negotiating with you.\par \par \uc2 LAMA HASAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) ...Lisa Vanderpump launching her newest experience.\par \par \uc2 LISA VANDERPUMP ("VANDERPUMP VILLA")\par \par \uc2 Welcome to "Vanderpump Villa."\par \par \uc2 LAMA HASAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) "GMA" got a first look.\par \par \uc2 LAMA HASAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Three words, how would you describe your new show?\par \par \uc2 LISA VANDERPUMP ("VANDERPUMP VILLA")\par \par \uc2 Decadent, naughty...\par \par \uc2 LAMA HASAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Naughty? We'll take that.\par \par \uc2 LISA VANDERPUMP ("VANDERPUMP VILLA")\par \par \uc2 ...And poignant.\par \par \uc2 LAMA HASAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Shot at a 19th-century chateau in the picturesque South of France. The unscripted docudrama follows staff, who live and work alongside guests for a luxurious stay of her standards.\par \par \uc2 LISA VANDERPUMP ("VANDERPUMP VILLA")\par \par \uc2 My intention is that it goes perfectly. It doesn't always.\par \par \uc2 REALITY TV CLIP\par \par \uc2 LISA VANDERPUMP ("VANDERPUMP VILLA")\par \par \uc2 That is such disrespect to me. This is Chateau Roosevelt that I have created.\par \par \uc2 LAMA HASAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) What does it take to impress you?\par \par \uc2 LISA VANDERPUMP ("VANDERPUMP VILLA")\par \par \uc2 Professionalism, understanding what it takes to really give the good service.\par \par \uc2 LAMA HASAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Your fans are dying to know, are we going to see a different side to Lisa on this show, "Vanderpump Villa"?\par \par \uc2 LISA VANDERPUMP ("VANDERPUMP VILLA")\par \par \uc2 Well, I think it's more immersive, this situation where the staff don't go home.\par \par \uc2 LAMA HASAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) The 12 chateau staff, hand-picked by Lisa, include an executive chef, housekeepers, servers and mixologists.\par \par \uc2 LAMA HASAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Marciano, I will ask you first, , what's going on in the chateau?\par \par \uc2 MARCIANO BRUNETTE (LEAD SERVER)\par \par \uc2 There's going to be a lot of emotions.\par \par \uc2 GRACE COTTRELL (HOUSEKEEPER)\par \par \uc2 Not only living together but working together. You know, there's no escaping.\par \par \uc2 TELLY HALL (MIXOLOGIST)\par \par \uc2 I'm the one that people spill the truth to. I have the serum.\par \par \uc2 LAMA HASAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) There's bound to be chaos.\par \par \uc2 LISA VANDERPUMP ("VANDERPUMP VILLA")\par \par \uc2 There's drama, a lot back of house. And sometimes things spill over to front of the house. That's my nightmare, and front of house is supposed to be totally unaware of what is going on behind the scenes.\par \par \uc2 TV CLIP FROM "VANDERPUMP VILLA"\par \par \uc2 PARTICIPANT ("VANDERPUMP VILLA")\par \par \uc2 Apologize. Say sorry, apologize.\par \par \uc2 PARTICIPANT ("VANDERPUMP VILLA")\par \par \uc2 Do you know how bad it looks fighting in front of the guests?\par \par \uc2 LISA VANDERPUMP ("VANDERPUMP VILLA")\par \par \uc2 I did not work this hard to have these little whippersnappers screw it up.\par \par \uc2 LAMA HASAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) What is something a potential employee can never do?\par \par \uc2 LISA VANDERPUMP ("VANDERPUMP VILLA")\par \par \uc2 Be rude to the guests.\par \par \uc2 LAMA HASAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) When you look at a resume, what's a nonstarter?\par \par \uc2 LISA VANDERPUMP ("VANDERPUMP VILLA")\par \par \uc2 When people have moved around too much. I like tenacity.\par \par \uc2 LAMA HASAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Is the boss always right?\par \par \uc2 LISA VANDERPUMP ("VANDERPUMP VILLA")\par \par \uc2 I would like to think the boss is always right, but I think I learn from every experience, too, and people sometimes surprise me.\par \par \uc2 LAMA HASAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Now it was time to check in to Vanderpump Villa.\par \par \uc2 PARTICIPANT ("VANDERPUMP VILLA")\par \par \uc2 Are you enjoying the beautiful view at the chateau?\par \par \uc2 LAMA HASAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Yes, thank you. Is this my tea?\par \par \uc2 PARTICIPANT ("VANDERPUMP VILLA")\par \par \uc2 This is.\par \par \uc2 LAMA HASAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Great, thank you very much. I could get used to this. Who doesn't love a bit of luxury? So sadly, we did have to check out of Vanderpump Villa, but don't worry because we will have more of Lisa Vanderpump on ABC News Live, as well as "Nightline," and it is streaming on \uc2 Hulu\uc2 . So, guys, get ready for some chateau shenanigans.\par \par \uc2 LARA SPENCER (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) You looked very at home there, fabulous, Lama.\par \par \uc2 GEORGE STEPHANOPOULOS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Thank you.\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020240423ek420000t\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 INTRODUCTION TO THE 8:30 HALF HOUR\b0\par\par\uc2 367 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 April 2024\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 STORM, TORNADOES, FLOODING\par \par \uc2 WEATHER, TRACK, STORM\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 , GAG ORDER, BOND\par \par \uc2 ABORTION BAN, FLORIDA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MAJOR FLORIDA ABORTION RULINGS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: COURT ALLOWS SIX-WEEK BAN BUT GIVES VOTERS FINAL SAY IN NOVEMBER\par \par \uc2 THREAT, \uc2 FBI\uc2 , ELLIS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: \uc2 FBI\uc2  OFFICE SCARE UNDER INVESTIGATION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: DRIVER IN CUSTODY AFTER SMALL SUV RAMS INTO ATLANTA OFFICE GATE\par \par \uc2 ISRAEL, IRAN, AIRSTRIKES, SYRIA, AKBARI\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MIDDLE EAST ESCALATION?\par \par \uc2 GRAPHIC