ame out earlier on the show and goes, "Bonjour," Lisa Vanderpump. All right, let's take a look at what's going on with these storms. I want to show you something, when you\u160\'00\'A0sometimes are looking at it through your camera on your phone, and you catch something like this. Let's zoom in a little bit because that's an airplane way up there above the power line. And notice the lightning strike goes all the way through the wings. Now, airplanes are engineered to handle lightning when they bring that airplane down. When they bring that airplane down, and everything was safe with it, they should check the electricals on the plane for sure, but they handle lightning, and generally, a plane will get struck once or twice a year, believe it or not.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: NEW WESTERN STORM\par \par \uc2 SAM CHAMPION (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) That's the weather around the nation as the next storm comes into California by Thursday. Here's what you can expect this morning.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: NATIONAL MAP\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) It is time to reveal our "GMA" book club pick for April. And let's just say it's here just in time for your next vacation. Lori B is back. Lori, there's a lot of love for this author and her books.\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020240423ek420000u\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 AS SEEN ON SOCIAL VIRAL PRODUCTS REVIEWED\b0\par\par\uc2 1,505 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 April 2024\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 STORM, TORNADOES, FLOODING\par \par \uc2 WEATHER, TRACK, STORM\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 , GAG ORDER, BOND\par \par \uc2 ABORTION BAN, FLORIDA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MAJOR FLORIDA ABORTION RULINGS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: COURT ALLOWS SIX-WEEK BAN BUT GIVES VOTERS FINAL SAY IN NOVEMBER\par \par \uc2 THREAT, \uc2 FBI\uc2 , ELLIS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: \uc2 FBI\u