 next must have. And I'm talking about Trader Joe's mini canvas bag. It has officially taken TikTok by storm.\par \par \uc2 TV CLIP FROM "SEX AND THE CITY"\par \par \uc2 ACTOR ("SEX AND THE CITY")\par \par \uc2 Look what I got.\par \par \uc2 SAM CHAMPION (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Good luck getting your hands on this spring's newest it bag.\par \par \uc2 TV CLIP FROM "SEX AND THE CITY"\par \par \uc2 ACTOR ("SEX AND THE CITY")\par \par \uc2 Your bag.\par \par \uc2 ACTOR ("SEX AND THE CITY")\par \par \uc2 It's a bagette.\par \par \uc2 SAM CHAMPION (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) No, not the Fendi or even the Birkin. And it's not the TELFAR.\par \par \uc2 TV CLIP FROM "ABBOTT ELEMENTARY"\par \par \uc2 ACTOR ("ABBOTT ELEMENTARY")\par \par \uc2 Put the caps on those pens, girl. That bag is expensive.\par \par \uc2 SAM CHAMPION (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) The Trader Joe's mini canvas tote.\par \par \uc2 SOCIAL MEDIA CONTENT PROVIDER (FEMALE)\par \par \uc2 I got it. It's so cute.\par \par \uc2 SAM CHAMPION (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 TikTokkers and shoppers alike are obsessed with the petite, limited edition version of the grocery chain's iconic shopping bag.\par \par \uc2 YJ WANG (TRADER JOE'S SHOPPER)\par \par \uc2 I had to wait maybe about 10 minutes for them to update some of the colors because the blue one and the green one were already kind of taken, but as I did the rest of my Trader Joe's shopping, they kind of restocked on the other colors, as well.\par \par \uc2 SAM CHAMPION (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) The heavy duty cotton and polyester blend carryall measures 13 by 11 inches and comes in four stylish colorways, retailing for a reasonable $2.99.\par \par \uc2 YJ WANG (TRADER JOE'S SHOPPER)\par \par \uc2 It's pretty crazy. It's kind of like Black Friday for these Trader Joe's bags.\par \par \uc2 SAM CHAMPION (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) It's totally chaos in stores, selling out everywhere after first gracing shelves just over two weeks ago.\par \par \uc2 ERICA WARK (FASHION STYLIST)\par \par \uc2 I can see why the bag is having a moment because it is very classic in its structure.\par \par \uc2 SAM CHAMPION (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 Now, resalers\u160\'00\'A0are cashing in on the craze, the bags fetching hundreds of dollars on \uc2 eBay\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 ERICA WARK (FASHION STYLIST)\par \par \uc2 Any time you mark something as limited edition or exclusive in any type of way, it already naturally drums up this need or want to have that item and that quick fix of buying something that you know a lot of other people aren't going to have.\par \par \uc2 SAM CHAMPION (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Trader Joe's tells ABC News that it does "not endorse the resale of any of our products anywhere." But customers who missed out on the first drop aren't totally out of luck. TJ's promises the coats will be restocked late in the summer.\par \par \uc2 SOCIAL MEDIA CONTENT PROVIDER (FEMALE)\par \par \uc2 Cute.\par \par \uc2 SAM CHAMPION (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) It's the first time, I don't even know what that was, it's the first time I've ever referred to trader Joe's as TJ's, by the way. I'm sure it's super cool. Now, we looked for hours around the city to find one of these, I swear we did. It is sold out everywhere. "GMA" viewer WJ Wang agreed to let us borrow hers. It is lit up like I, like I can't even imagine. It is another wordily glow. Patrick is guarding this. We can't, Patrick, if I do that, is that a bad thing? She also told us that since she posted her viral TikTok, people have been sending her nonstop messages asking to buy the bags from her. But again, you can't buy them, I mean, you can buy them second-market, but it's not a good idea because it's just way overpriced, and it comes back out late summer. So, just wait, $2.99 at TJ's, Robin.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) At TJ's. I'm sure they really appreciate that.\par \par \uc2 GEORGE STEPHANOPOULOS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) You never know what will take hold on TikTok, do you?\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) You have no idea. Patrick, stand down. I promise we're not going to, we can wait for the $2.99 version. Oh my goodness.\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020240403ek3e0000q\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 DEALS & STEALS KITCHEN AND HOME\b0\par\par\uc2 1,307 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 March 2024\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 WEATHER, TRACK, TORNADOES, STORM\par \par \uc2 WINTER STORM, TRAVEL\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: WINTER BLAST SLAMMING WEST\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: SNOW, WIND & AVALANCHE ALERTS FROM CALIFORNIA TO COLORADO\par \par \uc2 BOEING, AMERICAN AIRLINES\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: AMERICAN AIRLINES FLIGHT MAKES EMERGENCY LANDING\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: LATEST INCIDENT INVOLVING BOEING JET AMID GROWING SCRUTINY\par \par \uc2 PELOSI, GALLAGHER, ROY, CHEW, CRENSHAW, TIKTOK, BAN\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: HOUSE PASSES BILL TARGETING TIKTOK\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: SOCIAL PLATFORM COULD FACE U.S. BAN UNLESS SOLD BY CHINESE PARENT COMPANY\par \par \uc2 TRUMP\uc2 , WILLIS, ELECTION INTERFERENCE, RULING\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: SURPRISE RULING IN GEORGIA ELECTION INTERFERENCE CASE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: JUDGE DISMISSES SIX COUNTS AGAINST TRUMP & CO-DEFENDANTS\par \par \uc2 RESCUE, HAITI, ALBOM, DOLAN\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: RACE TO RESCUE AMERICANS STRANDED IN HAITI\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MARINES SENT TO PROTECT U.S. EMBASSY AMID GROWING CHAOS\par \par \uc2 ECONOMY, INFLATION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FAMILY DOLLAR & DOLLAR TREE TO CLOSE 1,000 STORES\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: DOWNSIZING RAISES CONCERNS ABOUT FOOD INSECURITY\par \par \uc2 DOGS, STRESS, BURROWS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: YOUR BRAIN ON PUPPIES!\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: WHAT A NEW STUDY REVEALS ABOUT DOGS & OUR HAPPINESS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 G