he QR codes on your screen right now to shop these items and even more of our picks for hard to buy, for people on your list, picked by Lori and our "GMA" shop team. All right. Tomorrow we have day two of our Ultimate Gifting Series. Coming up, Golden Globe-nominated Timothy Chalamet and his "Wonka" co-star, Calah Lane, are here live.\par \par \uc2 COMMERCIAL BREAK\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: STORY SYNOPSIS\par \par \uc2 COMMERCIAL BREAK\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020240103ejcc0003g\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 FLY SYMPTOMS OR HEART ATTACK? ONE MOM SHARES HER STORY & WARNING FOR OTHER WOMEN\b0\par\par\uc2 888 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 December 2023\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 WEATHER, TRACK, STORM, SNOW\par \par \uc2 ABORTION, TEXAS, RULING, COX\par \par \uc2 TRUMP, ELECTION INTERFERENCE, SMITH\par \par \uc2 ZELENSKYY, FUNDING, UKRAINE, WAR\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ZELENSKYY IN WASHINGTON TO APPEAL FOR \uc2 U.S. AID\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: UKRAINIAN LEADER SET TO MEET WITH PRESIDENT BIDEN & HOUSE SPEAKER\par \par \uc2 ABULHIYA, MILLER, WAR, ISRAEL, \uc2 HAMAS\uc2 , YADLIN, HOSTAGES, CUNIO\par \par \uc2 GIULIANI, DEFAMATION, MOSS, FREEMAN\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: RUDY GIULIANI SUED FOR MILLIONS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: JURY TO DETERMINE DAMAGES FOR FALSELY ACCUSED GEORGIA ELECTION WORKERS\par \par \uc2 TEXEIRA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: 15 AIR FORCE MEMBERS DISCIPLINED IN PENTAGON LEAK\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: INVESTIGATORS: MEMBERS OF SUSPECT'S UNIT FAILED TO TAKE "PROPER ACTION"\par \par \uc2 OHTANI, CONTRACT, MLB\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: NEW DETAILS ON OHTANI'S HISTORIC DEAL\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: SOURCES: NEWLY-MINTED DODGERS STAR TO DEFER $68 MILLION OF ANNUAL SALARY\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: RIGHT NOW\par \par \uc2 CLIP FROM MOVIE, "BARBIE"\par \par \uc2 MEDINA, ROMERO, STABBING, ARREST, DUBROC\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: HIGH SCHOOL CHEERLEADER MURDER INVESTIGATION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: POLICE SEARCH FOR MOTIVE AFTER ARREST OF SUSPECT IN 16-YEAR-OLD'S STABBING\par \par \uc2 CORCORAN, MORTGAGE, REAL ESTATE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: REAL ESTATE REALITY CHECK\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: BARBARA CORCORAN ON THE STATE OF THE HOUSING MARKET\par \par \uc2 GOLDEN GLOBE AWARDS, NOMINATIONS, "BARBENHEIMER"\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: "BARBENHEIMER" BLITZ!\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: BOX OFFICE PHENOMENONS RULE THE GOLDEN GLOBE NOMINATIONS\par \par \uc2 NFL\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PLAY OF THE DAY\par \par \uc2 TEXAS, ABORTION, COX, LAW, EXCEPTION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: TEXAS ABORTION BATTLE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: WOMAN LEAVES STATE FOR PROCEDURE\par \par \uc2 WEATHER, COLD, WINTER, CHILLS, TORNADO\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: BITTER COLD BLAST\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MILLIONS WAKING UP TO WINTER-LIKE WIND CHILLS\par \par \uc2 GOOGLE\uc2 , ANDROID, APP, LAWSUIT, ANTI-TRUST\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: \uc2 GOOGLE\uc2  LOSES APP STORE LAWSUIT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: JURY SAYS TECH GIANT VIOLATED ANTITRUST LAWS\par \par \uc2 HEART ATTACK, WOMEN, SYMPTOMS, FLU, TANNER\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FLY SYMPTOMS OR HEART ATTACK?\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ONE MOM SHARES HER STORY & WARNING FOR OTHER WOMEN\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) But how about our "GMA" cover story in the meantime? A mom who thought she was experiencing flu symptoms, but really she was having a heart attack. She was able to get help, thankfully, and now she's sharing a warning for other women. It's a story we first saw in "Business Insider," and Eva Pilgrim has those details for us. Good morning, Eva.\par \par \uc2 EVA PILGRIM (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Good morning, Robin. When most of us think about a heart attack, we think about chest pain as that classic symptom. But that's not the one symptom to look for, especially for women.\par \par \uc2 JENNA TANNER (SUFFERED HEART ATTACK)\par \par \uc2 I thought I was coming down with the flu or the upper respiratory infection or something.\par \par \uc2 EVA PILGRIM (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) After COVID and the flu moved through her family in 2022, 48-year-old Jenna Tanner felt like she was coming down with something, too.\par \par \uc2 JENNA TANNER (SUFFERED HEART ATTACK)\par \par \uc2 I was having fleeting pains in my chest that I really thought was my, I thought it was my lungs. I didn't want to tell my husband because I knew he would say we have to go straight to the hospital, and I didn't want to go spend any more time in waiting rooms at the doctor's office, so I ignored it.\par \par \uc2 EVA PILGRIM (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Ignoring the pain almost cost the Oklahoma resident her life. Two days later, she says she passed out. When she awoke, she knew instantly she was having a massive heart attack.\par \par \uc2 JENNA TANNER (SUFFERED HEART ATTACK)\par \par \uc2 It felt like an elephant was sitting on me. I couldn't move at all. It was very scary.\par \par \uc2 EVA PILGRIM (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Although heart disease is the number one killer of women in the US, experts say women are more likely to ignore and downplay symptoms.\par \par \uc2 DR. DARIEN SUTTON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Women can typically present with symptoms unrelated to chest pain, and I think that's one of the reasons they get downplayed, mainly because it doesn't feel typically like what you think a heart attack would feel like.\par \par \uc2 EVA PILGRIM (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) While the most common heart attack symptom for men and women is chest pain, women may sometimes only experience shortness of breath, nausea and back, shoulder or jaw pain.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: HOW TO TELL THE DIFFERENCE & PROTECT YOUR HEALTH\par \par \uc2 DR. DARIEN SUTTON (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) All of these symptoms, when they happen suddenly, you have to pay attention because they might be a sign of something more sinister.\par \par \uc2 EVA PILGRIM (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) Tanner dragged herself to her cell phone two rooms away and called for help. Three surgeries and two stents later, she is doing better and has a message for other women.\par \par \uc2 JENNA TANNER (SUFFERED HEART ATTACK)\par \par \uc2 Heart health for women is important. Don't ignore heart pain, even if you think it's your lungs, even if you've been to the doctor 20 times in the last two months with your children. Just make sure you take it seriously.\par \par \uc2 EVA PILGRIM (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) And if you notice that you're having chest pain, jaw pain or shoulder pain, and it's getting progressively worse, and you can't pinpoint exactly where it's coming from, you should see your doctor immediately, Dr. Sutton saying at the very least, stop by an urgent care and get an EKG. It could be nothing, but it could also save your life.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Great advice there. Thank you, Eva. We'll see you on "GMA3."\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020240103ejcc0003d\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 GOOD MORNING AMERICA\b0\par\par\uc2 494 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 December 2023\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 Good morning, America. A frigid cold blast for millions. Winter is coming.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: EXTREME WEATHER\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: BIG CHILL\par \par \uc2 RESIDENT (MALE)\par \par \uc2 Oh, my God.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 Big chill. As Tennessee cleans up after the tornado outbreak in freezing temperature, some still with no power. This morning, more details on the destruction after one twister was on the ground for 43 miles. Sam Champion is here tracking it all.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: NEW DEVELOPMENTS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ABORTION BAN BATTLE\par \par \uc2 GEORGE STEPHANOPOULOS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 Abortion ban battle. The Texas Supreme Court ruling in the case of the woman seeking an emergency abortion after her lawyers say she already left the state to get the procedure.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: TRUMP ELECTION INTERFERENCE CASE\par \par \uc2 GEORGE STEPHANOPOULOS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 New developments in the Trump election interference case. The Supreme Court responds after the special counsel asked for an expedited ruling on whether the former president has absolute immunity from prosecution.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: AIR FORCE MEMBERS DISCIPLINED\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PENTAGON LEAK FALLOUT\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 Pentagon leak fallout. More than a dozen Air Force members disciplined in the case of the air national guardsman accused of posting national security secrets online.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: NEW DETAILS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: TEXAS CHEERLEADER MURDER INVESTIGATION\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 New details in the murder of the Texas high school cheerleader. What investigators are now revealing about the case.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: THIS MORNING\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: \uc2 HASBRO\uc2  SLASHES WORK FORCE\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 Toymaker Hasbro slashing nearly 20% of its workforce. Why the maker of Transformers and Play-Doh is cutting jobs in the middle of the holiday shopping season.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: BARBARA CORCORAN LIVE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: REAL ESTATE REALITY CHECK\par \par \uc2 GEORGE STEPHANOPOULOS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 Real estate reality check. With mortgage rates dropping, is now the time to buy? "Shark Tank" star Barbara Corcoran answers your questions.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOLDEN GLOBE NOMINATIONS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: "BARBENHEIMER" BLITZ!\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 "Barbenhimer" blitz. The summer box office phenomenon leading the Golden Globe nominations. And will it be Ken-ough for the road to the Oscars?\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: NEW OVERNIGHT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MONDAY NIGHT MAYHEM!\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 Giant walk off win. Monday night mayhem in New York. And this Titan of a comeback.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: EPIC LIVE SURPRISE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: CELEBRATING HEALTH CARE HEROES!\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 And we're dancing our way into one of the biggest surprises in morning TV history, celebrating the wonderful health care heroes who go above and beyond to help others thrive.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: TUESDAY, DEC 12\par \par \uc2 ANNOUNCER\par \par \uc2 Live in Times Square, this is "Good Morning America."\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 This is good morning, America. We cannot wait to bring you that very special surprise right here in Times Square. It is huge.\par \par \uc2 GEORGE STEPHANOPOULOS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 We also have a lot of news to get to on this busy morning, including the big ruling in the Texas abortions case. Rachel Scott is going to have more on that in just a few moments.\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020240103ejcc0002t\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 POP NEWS\b0\par\par\uc2 1,178 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 December 2023\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 WEATHER, TRACK, STORM, SNOW\par \par \uc2 ABORTION, TEXAS, RULING, \uc2 COX\par \par \uc2 TRUMP, ELECTION INTERFERENCE, SMITH\par \par \uc2 ZELENSKYY, FUNDING, UKRAINE, WAR\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ZELENSKYY IN WASHINGTON TO APPEAL FOR \uc2 U.S. AID\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: UKRAINIAN LEADER SET TO MEET WITH PRESIDENT BIDEN & HOUSE SPEAKER\par \par \uc2 ABULHIYA, MILLER, WAR, ISRAEL, \uc2 HAMAS\uc2 , YADLIN, HOSTAGES, CUNIO\par \par \uc2 GIULIANI, DEFAMATION, MOSS, FREEMAN\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: RUDY GIULIANI SUED FOR MILLIONS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: JURY TO DETERMINE DAMAGES FOR FALSELY ACCUSED GEORGIA ELECTION WORKERS\par \par \uc2 TEXEIRA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: 15 AIR FORCE MEMBERS DISCIPLINED IN PENTAGON LEAK\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: INVESTIGATORS: MEMBERS OF SUSPECT'S UNIT FAILED TO TAKE "PROPER ACTION"\par \par \uc2 OHTANI, CONTRACT, MLB\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: NEW DETAILS ON OHTANI'S HISTORIC DEAL\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: SOURCES: NEWLY-MINTED DODGERS STAR TO DEFER $68 MILLION OF ANNUAL SALARY\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: RIGHT NOW\par \par \uc2 CLIP FROM MOVIE, "BARBIE"\par \par \uc2 MEDINA, ROMERO, STABBING, ARREST, DUBROC\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: HIGH SCHOOL CHEERLEADER MURDER INVESTIGATION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: POLICE SEARCH FOR MOTIVE AFTER ARREST OF SUSPECT IN 16-YEAR-OLD'S STABBING\par \par \uc2 CORCORAN, MORTGAGE, REAL ESTATE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: REAL ESTATE REALITY CHECK\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: BARBARA CORCORAN ON THE STATE OF THE HOUSING MARKET\par \par \uc2 GOLDEN GLOBE AWARDS, NOMINATIONS, "BARBENHEIMER"\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: "BARBENHEIMER" BLITZ!\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: BOX OFFICE PHENOMENONS RULE THE GOLDEN GLOBE NOMINATIONS\par \par \uc2 NFL\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PLAY OF THE DAY\par \par \uc2 TEXAS, ABORTION, \uc2 COX\uc2 , LAW, EXCEPTION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: TEXAS ABORTION BATTLE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: WOMAN LEAVES STATE FOR PROCEDURE\par \par \uc2 WEATHER, COLD, WINTER, CHILLS, TORNADO\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: BITTER COLD BLAST\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MILLIONS WAKING UP TO WINTER-LIKE WIND CHILLS\par \par \uc2 GOOGLE\uc2 , ANDROID, APP, LAWSUIT, ANTI-TRUST\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: \uc2 GOOGLE\uc2  LOSES APP STORE LAWSUIT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: JURY SAYS TECH GIANT VIOLATED ANTITRUST LAWS\par \par \uc2 HEART ATTACK, WOMEN, SYMPTOMS, FLU, TANNER\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FLY SYMPTOMS OR HEART ATTACK?\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ONE MOM SHARES HER STORY & WARNING FOR OTHER WOMEN\par \par \uc2 GOLDEN GLOBES, ANISTON, WITHERSPOON, KEYS\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) How about a little "Pop News" there, Lara?\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: HOLLYWOOD GEARS UP FOR GOLDEN GLOBES\par \par \uc2 LARA SPENCER (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Yes, ma'am, good morning to you and to you. We're going to begin with Hollywood's golden awards show. As we shared earlier, award season is now underway with the Golden Globe nominations out. "Barbie" and "\uc2 Oppenheimer\uc2 " leading the charge for film nominees, and this is really interesting. This year, there are 27 first-time nominees, including Ali\u160\'00\'A0Wong and Steve Young, both nominated for their roles in "Beef." Trevor Noah and Chris Rock both scored nominations in the brand new category, it's called Best Performance in Standup Comedy on TV. That category is so stacked, you guys, Wanda Sykes is also in it, Sarah Silverman, Amy Schumer and Ricky Gervais. I mean, tough to choose. All of them had terrific specials.\par \par \uc2 LARA SPENCER (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Also scoring nominations, "Succession" topped the TV nods with nine, including three nominations, each for Best Actor, Bryan Cox, Jeremy strong and Kieran Culkin. And \uc2 Hulu\uc2 's "The Bear" and "Only Murders in the Building" tied as the second most recognized series with five nods each, one of which was for Meryl Streep. If you didn't see it, you need to check her out in "Only Murders in the Building" for her supporting role. By the way, this shores up her record as the most nominated actress in Globes history, this being her 33rd nomination, unbelievable.\par \par \uc2 LARA SPENCER (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) It's just laughable at this point, right?\par \par \uc2 LARA SPENCER (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) I know, I wonder why, if she was like, "Oh, yeah,"\par \par \uc2 SAM CHAMPION (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Hey, Meryl, walk down the stairs, give her an award.\par \par \uc2 LARA SPENCER (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) She does it like no one else.\par \par \uc2 GEORGE STEPHANOPOULOS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) And she deserves it. She deserved it.\par \par \uc2 LARA SPENCER (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) And finally, guys, "The Crown" may just rule the night, making history as the first series to get nominations in Best Television Drama for every single one of its six seasons. The 2024 Golden Globes takes place Sunday, January 7. It's going to be a good one. Lots going on. Lots to see.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 I just enjoy Sam's sound effects.\par \par \uc2 SAM CHAMPION (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) It's all good stuff, though.\par \par \uc2 LARA SPENCER (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Are you ready? Another story coming.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: JENNIFER ANISTON AND REESE WITHERSPOON GET CANDID\par \par \uc2 LARA SPENCER (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) All right, here we go. Listen up, everybody. Also in the news this morning, our second favorite morning team is getting candid in a new interview. Jennifer Aniston and Reese Witherspoon sitting down with "Variety" to open up about their hit, "The Morning Show," and what it's been like working together for decades, starting with "Friends," when Reese played Jennifer's little sister. Aniston says it's now just in their DNA to collaborate, and Witherspoon adds that they are both in shock that they're still kicking around and working at the level that they are. I don't think you should be in shock, ladies. You're actually quite terrific at what you do.\par \par \uc2 LARA SPENCER (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) At the end of the interview, though, Jennifer did open up about her late friend Matthew Perry sharing, quote, "I was literally texting with him that morning. Funny Matty. He was not in pain. He was not struggling. He was happy." Aniston going on to add that she wants people to know that Perry really was happy and really healthy, stating, "I miss him dearly, we all do. Boy, he made us laugh." Jennifer Aniston and Reese Witherspoon's full interview is in "Variety" now. It is a great one. Check it out.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) So glad that she shared that.\par \par \uc2 LARA SPENCER (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) I think that was important. I think that's what he wanted people to know. She's a great friend.\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ALICIA KEYS SUPRISES LONDON COMMUTERS\par \par \uc2 LARA SPENCER (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) And if you were in London on Monday at a tube station thinking, "Wow, that person singing 'Empire State of Mind' is really good," well, you were correct. It was, in fact, Alicia Keys singing her heart out as a little surprise for commuters. Take a look at this.\par \par \uc2 LARA SPENCER (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Look at that. I just got chills. How great is that? Love that she changed the lyrics from her hit, "Empire State of Mind." She also performed some of her other hit songs, including "No One" and "If I Ain't Got You," before singing her latest single. It's called "Lifeline." It's so good. It's from "The Color Purple." And those keys that Keys is playing, they're quite special. that is the Elton John piano, named for Elton because he donated it to the station for commuters to enjoy and play, like she did. The night before, Alicia was\u160\'00\'A0playing for a slightly larger crowd at the 02 Arena. Her new song, "Lifeline," by the way, out now, and "The Color Purple" is out on Christmas Day. Cannot wait for that.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) I can't wait, I know.\par \par \uc2 LARA SPENCER (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) And that's "Pop News."\par \par \uc2 GEORGE STEPHANOPOULOS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Thank you, Lara.\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020240103ejcc0003e\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 VIRGINIA & ANDREA BOCELLI PERFORM LIVE "LET IT SNOW" FROM "A FAMILY CHRISTMAS"\b0\par\par\uc2 403 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 December 2023\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2023, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 WEATHER, TRACK, STORM, SNOW\par \par \uc2 ABORTION, TEXAS, RULING, COX\par \par \uc2 TRUMP, ELECTION INTERFERENCE, SMITH\par \par \uc2 ZELENSKYY, FUNDING, UKRAINE, WAR\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ZELENSKYY IN WASHINGTON TO APPEAL FOR \uc2 U.S. AID\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: UKRAINIAN LEADER SET TO MEET WITH PRESIDENT BIDEN & HOUSE SPEAKER\par \par \uc2 ABULHIYA, MILLER, WAR, ISRAEL, \uc2 HAMAS\uc2 , YADLIN, HOSTAGES, CUNIO\par \par \uc2 GIULIANI, DEFAMATION, MOSS, FREEMAN\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: RUDY GIULIANI SUED FOR MILLIONS\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: JURY TO DETERMINE DAMAGES FOR FALSELY ACCUSED GEORGIA ELECTION WORKERS\par \par \uc2 TEXEIRA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: 15 AIR FORCE MEMBERS DISCIPLINED IN PENTAGON LEAK\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: INVESTIGATORS: MEMBERS OF SUSPECT'S UNIT FAILED TO TAKE "PROPER ACTION"\par \par \uc2 OHTANI, CONTRACT, MLB\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: NEW DETAILS ON OHTANI'S HISTORIC DEAL\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: SOURCES: NEWLY-MINTED DODGERS STAR TO DEFER $68 MILLION OF ANNUAL SALARY\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: RIGHT NOW\par \par \uc2 CLIP FROM MOVIE, "BARBIE"\par \par \uc2 MEDINA, ROMERO, STABBING, ARREST, DUBROC\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: HIGH SCHOOL CHEERLEADER MURDER INVESTIGATION\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: POLICE SEARCH FOR MOTIVE AFTER ARREST OF SUSPECT IN 16-YEAR-OLD'S STABBING\par \par \uc2 CORCORAN, MORTGAGE, REAL ESTATE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: REAL ESTATE REALITY CHECK\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: BARBARA CORCORAN ON THE STATE OF THE HOUSING MARKET\par \par \uc2 GOLDEN GLOBE AWARDS, NOMINATIONS, "BARBENHEIMER"\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: "BARBENHEIMER" BLITZ!\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: BOX OFFICE PHENOMENONS RULE THE GOLDEN GLOBE NOMINATIONS\par \par \uc2 NFL\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PLAY OF THE DAY\par \par \uc2 TEXAS, ABORTION, COX, LAW, EXCEPTION\par \par \uc2